# CODEOWNERS — who must review what
#
# Rules are evaluated bottom-up: the LAST matching pattern wins, so put the most specific paths last.
# These owners are required IN ADDITION to the two approvals in GOVERNANCE.md §5; they never replace
# a normal review.
#
# PLACEHOLDERS: `@InferTurbo/<team>` names below must exist as teams in the InferTurbo organisation.
# An owner that does not resolve is silently ignored by the platform, which means the review is NOT
# enforced. Before relying on this file, replace every team name with a real one (or with individual
# handles), and keep it in sync with MAINTAINERS.md.
#
# If the hosting platform (GitCode) does not read CODEOWNERS, encode the same mapping in the branch
# protection rule "required reviewers / required approvals by area" so the intent survives the tool.

# --- default ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                                   @InferTurbo/maintainers

# --- project process and policy ---------------------------------------------------------------
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @InferTurbo/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.zh-CN.md              @InferTurbo/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md                      @InferTurbo/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.zh-CN.md                @InferTurbo/maintainers
/MAINTAINERS.md                     @InferTurbo/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                 @InferTurbo/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.zh-CN.md           @InferTurbo/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                        @InferTurbo/security
/SECURITY.zh-CN.md                  @InferTurbo/security
/docs/branching.md                  @InferTurbo/maintainers
/docs/branching.zh-CN.md            @InferTurbo/maintainers

# --- user-facing documentation ----------------------------------------------------------------
/docs/                              @InferTurbo/maintainers

# --- scheduling and load balancing (request-routing correctness) -------------------------------
/pkg/common/scheduler/              @InferTurbo/scheduler
/pkg/route-server/scheduler/        @InferTurbo/scheduler

# --- cluster coordination, leader election, instance registry ----------------------------------
/pkg/common/cluster/                @InferTurbo/cluster
/pkg/route-server/cluster/          @InferTurbo/cluster
/pkg/route-server/instances/        @InferTurbo/cluster

# --- HTTP surface, middleware and TLS: security sensitive --------------------------------------
/pkg/common/http/                   @InferTurbo/security
/pkg/route-server/middleware/       @InferTurbo/security
/pkg/route-server/handler/          @InferTurbo/security

# --- build, packaging and deployment assets ----------------------------------------------------
